Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,This film's producer wasn't a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:02.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,studio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was five lakh Gujarati
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.91,0:00:04.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,farmers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.89,0:00:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Anand, where, led by Dr
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:07.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kurien,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Amul became the farmers'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:09.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:12.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kurien and Shyam Benegal wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:13.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,it on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:15.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,But who would pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:17.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The farmers! ₹2 each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:19.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Five lakh farmers, ₹10 lakh:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:21.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,almost the whole budget!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:23.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why the first title
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,reads:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:25.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,'500,000 farmers of Gujarat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:25.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,present'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.31,0:00:28.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Farmers came by the truckload to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,see their film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,And 48 years later, Manthan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,reached Cannes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,India's first crowdfunded film.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:35.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you sending this to?
